{"2400550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Little Houses of Bloomwood", "steam_appid": 2400550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD, DECORATE, AND GARDEN !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Little Houses of Bloomwood</i> is a charming <strong>cozy game</strong> where creativity is your greatest asset. <strong>Build</strong>, <strong>decorate</strong>,<strong> customize</strong>, and <strong>garden</strong> with a <strong>powerful design system</strong> ! Build a new community of endearing characters on the island of Bloomwood, bring their projects to life, design your own home, and make it the most welcoming place of all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2400550/extras/fbf03c8396f4dce1f98685c456ce2577.avif?t=1774943142\" width=616 height=312 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE BLOOMWOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as an architect</strong> who just moved to the small island town of Bloomwood, far from the noise of the big city of Mooncrest. Discover its rich history, whimsical areas, and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2400550/extras/601996d84552f139942eb97363f01522.avif?t=1774943142\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONNECT WITH THE COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your neighbors, help them with their renovation projects, and discover their strong <strong>personalities </strong>and rich backstories, which will put your <strong>matchmaking talents</strong> to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_